      "content": "For the high-end skincare, you should target the affluent, white-collar demographic, likely professionals in finance or tech who value status and exclusivity. They are accustomed to spending heavily on self-care and follow trends set by high-society influencers. For the budget cleaners, focus on working-class families, perhaps those with multiple children, who are highly price-sensitive and prioritize function over fancy packaging. Their lifestyle is centered around practicality and managing a tight household budget.",
